        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ivyo vyateguwe birtyo, abaherezi na ntaryo bama binjira mw ihema ryo hino, kugira ngo bashitse ivy’ ubuherezi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
