            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Kristo amaze kuza, umuherezi mukuru w’ivyiza bizoza, aca mw ihema rirusha rya rindi kuba irihambaye n’iritunganye rwose, ritākozwe n’intoke, bisobanurwa ngo ritar’ iryo mu vyaremwe vy’ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ amaraso y’impene cank’ ay’ amashūri, si yo yamushikanye ahēra cane, ariko yahashikanywe n’ayiwe maraso rimwe gusa, yironkeye ugucungura kw’ibihe bidashira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
