        {
          "text": "mbeg’ amaraso ya Kristo, uwo yitanze ku Mana atagira agasembga, abitewe na Mpwemu ahoraho, ntazorushiriza guhumanura imitima yanyu ngw ibikorwa vy’impfagusa biyivemwo, kugira ngo mubone ingene mukorera Imana nzima?",
