              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukw iyo biba birtyo, aba yar’ akwiye kubabazwa kenshi uhereye ku kuremwa kw’ isi. Yamar’ ubu yabonetse rimwe kw iherezo ry’ibihe, kugira ngw akūzeh’ icaha ukwitanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
